# メタルギアソリッド (Metal Gear Solid, SLPM-86111/86112): the kanji that scenes and radio calls bring with them.
# A list of lines brings the pictures of its own kanji (36 bytes each: 12 by 12, two bits a pixel) and numbers
# them anew, so a code says nothing; a picture is known by the 64-bit FNV-1a hash of its 36 bytes (text.hash).
